hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1751","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gosht laaya gaya. To Aapki taraf dasta badhaaya gaya jabke wo Aap ko pasand tha. To Aap ne us mein se nawala liya, phir farmaya: Main Qiyaamat key din logon ka sardaar hun. Aur kya tum jaantey ho ke wo kis wajah se hai? Allah logon ko pehlon aur pichhlon ko aik maidaan mein jama karega. Pukaarne wala unhey sunaayega aur nigaah unhey paar karegi aur sooraj qareeb ho jaaeyga. To logon ko gham aur takleef pahunchegi jo wo bardaasht na kar sakengey aur na utha sakengey. To log kahengey: Kya tum nahi dekhtey jo tumhey pahunch chuka hai. Kya tum nahi dekhtey kaun tumhaarey liye tumhaarey Rab se sifaarish karega? To baaz log baaz se kahengey: Tum Aadam key paas jao. To wo Aadam (Alaihissalam) key paas aaeengey aur un se kahengey: Tum bashar key baap ho. Allah ne tumhey apne haath se paida kya aur tum mein apni rooh se phoonka aur farishton ko hukm diya aur unhon-ne tumhey sajda kya. Hamaarey liye apne Rab se sifaarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? Kya tum nahi dekhtey jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? To Aadam kahengey: Beshak mera Rab aaj ghussa hua hai jo us se pehley us jaisa kabhi ghussa nahi hua aur na uskey baad us jaisa ghussa hoga. Aur beshak us ne mujhey darkht se mana kya tha aur main ne uski naafarmaani ki. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan! Merey siwa key paas jao. Nuh key paas jao. To wo Nuh key paas aaeengey aur kahengey: Ae Nuh! Beshak tum zameen walon ki taraf pehley Rasool ho. Aur beshak Allah ne tumhey shukr guzaar banda kaha hai. Hamaarey liye apne Rab se sifaarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To wo kahega: Beshak mera Rab aaj ghussa hua hai jo us se pehley us jaisa kabhi ghussa nahi hua aur na uskey baad us jaisa ghussa hoga. Aur beshak meri dua thi jo main ne apni qaum par ki thi. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan! Merey siwa key paas jao. Ibrahim key paas jao. To wo Ibrahim key paas aaeengey aur kahengey: Ae Ibrahim! Tum Allah key Nabi aur zameen walon mein uskey Khaleel ho. Hamaarey liye apne Rab se sifaarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To wo un se kahega: Beshak mera Rab aaj ghussa hua hai jo us se pehley us jaisa kabhi ghussa nahi hua aur na uskey baad us jaisa ghussa hoga. Aur beshak main ne teen jhoot kaha tha. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan! Merey siwa key paas jao. Musa key paas jao. To wo Musa key paas aaeengey aur kahengey: Ae Musa! Tum Allah key Rasool ho. Allah ne tumhey apne paighaam aur apne kalaam se logon par fazeelat di hai. Hamaarey liye apne Rab se sifaarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To wo kahega: Beshak mera Rab aaj ghussa hua hai jo us se pehley us jaisa kabhi ghussa nahi hua aur na uskey baad us jaisa ghussa hoga? Aur beshak main ne jaan qatl ki thi jiskay qatl ka mujhey hukm nahi diya gaya tha. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan! Merey siwa key paas jao. Isa bin Maryam key paas jao. To wo Isa key paas aaeengey aur kahengey: Ae Isa! Tum Allah key Rasool aur uska kalimat ho jo us ne Maryam ki taraf daala aur uski taraf se rooh ho. Aur tum ne jhule mein bachchey hotey huey logon se baat ki thi. Hamaarey liye apne Rab se sifaarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To Isa kahega: Beshak mera Rab aaj ghussa hua hai jo us se pehley us jaisa kabhi ghussa nahi hua aur na uskey baad us jaisa ghussa hoga. Aur us ne gunaah zikr nahi kya. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan! Merey siwa key paas jao. Muhammad key paas jao. To wo Muhammad key paas aaeengey. To wo kahengey: Ae Muhammad! Tum Allah key Rasool aur Nabiyon key aakhir ho. Aur beshak Allah ne tumhaarey agley aur pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye hain. Hamaarey liye apne Rab se sifaarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To main chalunga aur Arsh key neechey aakar apne Rab Azza wa Jall ko sajda karta hua girunga. Phir Allah mujh par apni tareefon aur uski achhi sana mein se kuchh kholega jo us ne mujh se pehley kisi par nahi khola tha. Phir kaha jaaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao! Maango, diya jaaeyga. Aur sifaarish karo, qabool ki jaaeygi. To main apna sar uthaaunga aur kahunga: Meri ummat ae merey Rab! Meri ummat ae merey Rab! Meri ummat ae merey Rab! To kaha jaaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apni ummat mein se jinka hisaab nahi hai unhey Jannat key darwaazon mein se daaen darwaazay se daakhil karo. Aur wo logon key shareek hain uskey siwa jo darwaazon mein se hai. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak Jannat key darwaazon key donon paton key darmiyaan Makkah aur Himyar key darmiyaan jaisa hai. Ya Makkah aur Busra key darmiyaan jaisa. (Bukhari: 4712). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Shayed tumhaara Rab tumhey Maqaam-e-Mahmood par bhejey)."
"1752","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Beshak log Qiyaamat key din ghutnon par ho jaaengey. Har ummat apne Nabi key peechey chaleygi. Wo kahengey: Ae fulaan sifaarish karo! Ae fulaan sifaarish karo! Yahan tak ke sifaarish Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchegi. To wo din hai jab Allah Aap ko Maqaam-e-Mahmood par bhejega. (Bukhari: 4718). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur apni namaz mein buland aawaaz na karo aur na aahista karo)."
"1753","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Allah Taala key qaul (Aur apni namaz mein buland aawaaz na karo aur na aahista karo) key baarey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo naazil hui jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah mein chhupay huey they. Aap jab apne sahaaba key sath namaz padhtey to Quran se apni aawaaz buland kartey. Phir jab mushrikeen suntey to Quran ko aur jise naazil kya aur jo ley kar aaya use gaali detey. To Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya: (Aur apni namaz mein buland aawaaz na karo) yaani apni qiraat se, ke mushrikeen sunein aur Quran ko gaali dein. (Aur use aahista na karo) apne sahaaba se, ke tum unhey na sunaao. (Aur uskey darmiyaan raasta chaaho). (Bukhari: 4722). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Wo jinhon-ne apne Rab ki aayaton aur uskey milney ka kufr kya) aayat."
